 "body_text": "Back to Blog\n\n The 3 Best Door County Wine Tasting spots\n\n Door County  Wine Tasting\nSo get back from your kayak tour, saddle up to the wine bar and have a wine tasting at one of the great wineries in Door county.\n\nOne of there wines has a full taste of Door county cherries, though I am not a huge fan of most sweet wines and especially those trying to achieve Door County Cherry status, “door county cliche’.\n\nList coming soon.\n\n Posted in: \n\n Kayaking\n\nTweet\n\n Email\n\n Previous Post\n\n Next Post",
